 "text": "Hey, good to hear from you. Are you okay? That's a big one. She's likely excited to see you both, and small misunderstandings to turn into. Sure, no rush. So, how did it end? She left, or you two stopped talking? If it' paid, she can come back at any time. The key question is, is there still anger and resentment between you? Welcome back. Start with small acts of hospitality, like fresh coffee and new towels. Ask her about her day and really listen. Make it short first. Ten minutes after that, and only a few days each, so it feels fresh.",
